{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_018NxdC41dggghpr2UaFfsBJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both gates are green with the corrected counts: green-verify 204 (the 10 new in-process tests), verify-all 231 (adds the 3 process-suite parity tests). Baseline 218 → 231.\n\nFinal state of the work, for the record: attempt 003 had implemented the full story (delete operations, parameterized drop-vs-clear cascade, deleted-read filters, CLI commands, all tests) before the provider crashed. My pass verified that work against the story/tech-design/test-plan, then completed three things it had left undone: the parity-suite failure was a stale `dist` (fixed by build, which the gates always run), the two new test files needed recording in the red-manifest per the project's convention, and `test/cli-process-mutations-delete.test.ts` was missing from the `vitest.config.ts` process-suite exclusion list, so it was running inside plain `verify` against the build artifact — contradicting the suite convention.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"ready-for-verification\",\n  \"planSummary\": \"Resumed after attempt 003's provider crash, which had left a complete in-tree implementation. Verified it against the story, tech design (Flows 5/6, §Mechanics, DD-8), and test plan: messages.deleteMessage and turns.deleteTurn stamp deleted_at on projection rows only (events untouched), share Story 5's cascade via a drop-vs-clear parameterized core (deleted subject's forms DELETE'd, upward forms cleared+re-queued at the next source version, queued items superseded), prompt protection refuses initiating-prompt deletes with message_initiates_turn naming the turn and both turns-delete paths, empty chunks drop their summary forms with no rebuild queued, and the deleted-read filter covers message reads, turn reads, membership, chunk member loads, and composition inputs (proven by captureInputs in TC-6.5). Completed the unfinished tail: rebuilt dist (parity tests had failed only on a stale build), recorded the two new test files in the red-manifest per project convention, and added the new process-suite file to vitest.config.ts's exclusion list so it runs under verify-all only. Both gates green.\",\n  \"changedFiles\": [\n    { \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/index.ts\", \"reason\": \"deleteMessage operation (validation incl. prompt protection, deleted_at stamp, delete cascade) and applyTurnDeleteCascade cross-domain surface for turns.deleteTurn (DD-8 one cascade, two callers)\" },\n    { \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/internal/cascade.ts\", \"reason\": \"drop-vs-clear parameterized core cascade; cascadeMessageDelete and cascadeTurnDelete entry points; empty-chunk drop path; supersede of queued items against dropped subjects\" },\n    { \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/internal/store.ts\", \"reason\": \"markMessageDeleted/markTurnMessagesDeleted tombstone writes (live-row scoped); initiatesTurn on the validation read; deleted-read filter on readMessages\" },\n    { \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/domains/turns/index.ts\", \"reason\": \"deleteTurn operation: filtered validation, turn-row stamp, shared cascade via the messages domain's public surface\" },\n    { \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/domains/turns/internal/store.ts\", \"reason\": \"readMutableTurn filtered validation read; markTurnDeleted; deleted-read filters on readTurns turn rows and membership\" },\n    { \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/cli/turns-mutate.ts\", \"reason\": \"NEW per tech design §Placement: lhc turns delete command\" },\n    { \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/cli/messages-mutate.ts\", \"reason\": \"lhc messages delete command\" },\n    { \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/cli/index.ts\", \"reason\": \"messages delete / turns delete dispatch, --message/--turn flag parsing, usage text\" },\n    { \"path\": \"packages/lhc/test/mutations-delete.test.ts\", \"reason\": \"NEW: TC-6.1 through TC-6.7 plus live-row-walk and background-mode production-path tests\" },\n    { \"path\": \"packages/lhc/test/cli-process-mutations-delete.test.ts\", \"reason\": \"NEW: TC-6.8 SDK/CLI parity twins plus CLI refusal parity (process suite)\" },\n    { \"path\": \"packages/lhc/test/red-manifest.json\", \"reason\": \"recorded the two new Story 6 test files (hash-lock convention from prior stories)\" },\n    { \"path\": \"packages/lhc/vitest.config.ts\", \"reason\": \"fix found in self-review: new process-suite file added to the LHC_PROCESS_SUITE exclusion list so it runs under verify-all only, matching every other cli-process file\" }\n  ],\n  \"tests\": {\n    \"added\": [\"test/mutations-delete.test.ts\", \"test/cli-process-mutations-delete.test.ts\"],\n    \"modified\": [],\n    \"removed\": [],\n    \"totalAfterStory\": 231,\n    \"deltaFromPriorBaseline\": 13\n  },\n  \"gatesRun\": [\n    { \"command\": \"pnpm vitest run test/mutations-delete.test.ts\", \"result\": \"pass\" },\n    { \"command\": \"LHC_PROCESS_SUITE=1 pnpm vitest run test/cli-process-mutations-delete.test.ts\", \"result\": \"pass\" },\n    { \"command\": \"pnpm run green-verify\", \"result\": \"pass\" },\n    { \"command\": \"pnpm run verify-all\", \"result\": \"pass\" }\n  ],\n  \"selfReview\": {\n    \"findingsFixed\": [\n      \"TC-6.8 parity tests failed against a stale dist/cli.js lacking the delete subcommands — environmental, not code; resolved by build (red-verify always rebuilds, so the gates were never at risk)\",\n      \"test/cli-process-mutations-delete.test.ts was absent from vitest.config.ts's process-suite exclusion list, so it ran inside plain verify/green-verify against the build artifact instead of under verify-all only — added to the list; green-verify now counts 204 (in-process only) and verify-all 231\",\n      \"the two new test files were not yet recorded in test/red-manifest.json — recorded per the convention every prior story followed (immutability gate now pins 27 files)\"\n    ],\n    \"findingsSurfaced\": [\n      \"handler source reads in messages/internal/forms.ts (message row/blocks loaded at derivation time) carry no deleted_at filter — deliberate: they are not in §Mechanics' site list, and a handler racing a delete is already harmless because the dropped form row makes its UPDATE-only completion discard as stale_discarded, with queued items superseded by the cascade; composition and chunk-summary input reads (the sites that matter) are filtered and proven by TC-6.2/TC-6.5 capture assertions\",\n      \"cascade chainSubjects walk is deliberately unfiltered (commented in code): it runs after the delete stamps its subject, and the chain above a just-deleted record is exactly what must still cascade\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"openQuestions\": [],\n  \"specDeviations\": [\n    \"TC-6.1–6.7 live in new test/mutations-delete.test.ts rather than the test plan's test/mutations.test.ts, and TC-6.8 in new test/cli-process-mutations-delete.test.ts rather than cli-process-work.test.ts — both target files are hash-locked in the red manifest by earlier stories; new-file-per-story is the approved Story 4/5 precedent (green may add files, not edit Red's)\",\n    \"CLI flags spelled --message / --turn with --message-id / --turn-id accepted as aliases — extends Story 5's approved --message/--message-id alias deviation to the delete commands\"\n  ],\n  \"recommendedNextStep\": \"Hand to the story verifier: all TC-6.x and architecture-risk tests green, both gates pass at 204/231 (baseline 218 → 231, +13), DoD items checked (event read-back byte-stable in every delete variant, no unfiltered read path on the §Mechanics site list, CLI parity).\"\n}\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":314,"cache_read_input_tokens":115505,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":314},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0b78a89b-de9b-459e-9df3-9832eb021204","uuid":"4a3a7083-a208-4352-a9fa-e4699f6eeb18","request_id":"req_011Cbw7K6ss6XiPn4Nw8Yuiv"}
